      "values:originalText": "Treasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the\nAustralian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018\n\nCompilation date: 10/08/2022\nRegistered: 25/08/2022\n\nCommencement information\nColumn 1\nColumn 2\nColumn 3\nProvisions\nCommencement\nDate/Details\nAssent.",
