      "dc:source": "c2022c00235.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "A day or days to be fixed by Proclamation.\nHowever, if any of the provisions do not\ncommence within the period of 4 years\nbeginning on the day this Act receives the\nRoyal Assent, they commence on the day\nafter the end of that period.",
      "skos:definition": "A day or days to be fixed by Proclamation.\nHowever, if any of the provisions do not\ncommence within the period of 4 years\nbeginning on the day this Act receives the\nRoyal Assent, they commence on the day\nafter the end of that period.",
      "cml:asserts": [
