      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1050(4) Minister may authorise an external dispute resolution scheme",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Minister may, by notifiable instrument, vary or revoke an\nauthorisation of an external dispute resolution scheme."
