      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2022c00235.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2022c00235.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "The general considerations for an external dispute resolution\nscheme are the following:\n\n(a) the accessibility of the scheme;\n\n(b) the independence of the scheme;\n\n(c) the fairness of the scheme;\n\n(d) the accountability of the scheme;\n\n(e) the efficiency of the scheme;\n\n(f) the effectiveness of the scheme.",
      "skos:definition": "The general considerations for an external dispute resolution\nscheme are the following:\n\n(a) the accessibility of the scheme;\n\n(b) the independence of the scheme;\n\n(c) the fairness of the scheme;\n\n(d) the accountability of the scheme;\n\n(e) the efficiency of the scheme;\n\n(f) the effectiveness of the scheme.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1051a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1051a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "507cb54cd499f59c53462eae0005722bd030c7635750779b98a9759d4ba20bcc",
      "skos:note": "General considerations for an external dispute resolution scheme"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-1-sec-1051a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1051A General considerations",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 16,
      "values:originalText": "The general considerations for an external dispute resolution\nscheme are the following:\n\n(a) the accessibility of the scheme;\n\n(b) the independence of the scheme;\n\n(c) the fairness of the scheme;\n\n(d) the accountability of the scheme;\n\n(e) the efficiency of the scheme;\n\n(f) the effectiveness of the scheme."
    },
