      "cof:title": "1052B(2) Directions to increase limits on the value of claims",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 16,
      "values:originalText": "(2) However:\n\n(a) ASIC must not give a direction under this section unless\nASIC has given AFCA written notice of at least 1 month of\nASIC’s intention to issue the direction; and\n\n(b) a direction under this section must not apply in relation to\ncomplaints AFCA received before ASIC gives the direction."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1052b-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1052b-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1052b-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Cannot",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition of giving a direction without prior notice.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "ASIC must not give a direction under this section.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "AFCA has been notified at least 1 month in advance."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1052b-ss-2-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Cannot",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition of applying the direction to complaints received before notice.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "A direction under this section must not apply in relation to complaints AFCA received before ASIC gives the direction.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Complaints prior to notice are exempt from the direction."
    },
    {
