      "dc:source": "c2022c00235.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "(10) ASIC may revoke the direction, by giving written notice to AFCA,\nif, at the time of revocation, ASIC considers that the direction is no\nlonger necessary or appropriate.",
