    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1052d",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1052D Approval of material changes to the AFCA scheme",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-1-sec-1052d"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2022c00235.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2022c00235.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "(1) AFCA may request ASIC to approve a material change to the\nAFCA scheme.\nNote:\nA material change must not be made to the scheme without ASIC’s\napproval (see paragraph 1051(5)(b)).\n\n(2) ASIC may, by written notice given to AFCA, approve the change.\n\n(3) In considering whether to approve the change, ASIC must take into\naccount the following in relation to the scheme as it is proposed to\nbe changed:\n\nSchedule 1  External dispute resolution",
      "skos:definition": "(1) AFCA may request ASIC to approve a material change to the\nAFCA scheme.\nNote:\nA material change must not be made to the scheme without ASIC’s\napproval (see paragraph 1051(5)(b)).\n\n(2) ASIC may, by written notice given to AFCA, approve the change.\n\n(3) In considering whether to approve the change, ASIC must take into\naccount the following in relation to the scheme as it is proposed to\nbe changed:\n\nSchedule 1  External dispute resolution",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1052d-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1052d-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1052d-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0797a28451aa3e2d29cef098037a4c4b3874f96cff8820bd040a317f837cd3ea"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-1-sec-1052d",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1052D Approval of material changes to the AFCA scheme",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "(1) AFCA may request ASIC to approve a material change to the\nAFCA scheme.\nNote:\nA material change must not be made to the scheme without ASIC’s\napproval (see paragraph 1051(5)(b)).\n\n(2) ASIC may, by written notice given to AFCA, approve the change.\n\n(3) In considering whether to approve the change, ASIC must take into\naccount the following in relation to the scheme as it is proposed to\nbe changed:\n\nSchedule 1  External dispute resolution"
    },
