      },
      "dc:source": "c2022c00235.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In considering whether to approve the change, ASIC must take into\naccount the following in relation to the scheme as it is proposed to\nbe changed:\n\nSchedule 1  External dispute resolution",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In considering whether to approve the change, ASIC must take into\naccount the following in relation to the scheme as it is proposed to\nbe changed:\n\nSchedule 1  External dispute resolution",
      "values:partOf": {
