    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1052e-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1052E(4) Referring matters to appropriate authorities",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-1-sec-1052e-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2022c00235.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2022c00235.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If AFCA considers that there is a systemic issue arising from the\nconsideration of complaints under the AFCA scheme, AFCA must\ngive particulars of the issue to one or more of APRA, ASIC or the\nCommissioner of Taxation.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If AFCA considers that there is a systemic issue arising from the\nconsideration of complaints under the AFCA scheme, AFCA must\ngive particulars of the issue to one or more of APRA, ASIC or the\nCommissioner of Taxation.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1052e"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
