      },
      "dc:source": "c2022c00235.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the complainant fails to attend the conference, AFCA may deal\nwith the complaint as if it had been withdrawn by the complainant.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If the complainant fails to attend the conference, AFCA may deal\nwith the complaint as if it had been withdrawn by the complainant.",
