      "cml:conclusionText": "The determination spreads through the implementation of the determination."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1055b-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1055B(2) Operation of determination of superannuation complaint",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-1-sec-1055b-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2022c00235.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2022c00235.pdf, p.30",
      "values:originalText": "(2) AFCA may specify in the determination that the determination is\nnot to come into operation until a later date specified in the\n\nExternal dispute resolution  Schedule 1\nAmendments applying from the day after Royal Assent  Part 1\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the\nAustralian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018\nCompilation date: 10/08/2022\nRegistered: 25/08/2022\n\ndetermination and, if a later date is so specified, the determination\ncomes into operation on that date.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) AFCA may specify in the determination that the determination is\nnot to come into operation until a later date specified in the\n\nExternal dispute resolution  Schedule 1\nAmendments applying from the day after Royal Assent  Part 1\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the\nAustralian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018\nCompilation date: 10/08/2022\nRegistered: 25/08/2022\n\ndetermination and, if a later date is so specified, the determination\ncomes into operation on that date.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1055b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1055b-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6c9c06e24eb3e470e7fb6468f5502d4998dd5a761559c509e3502547f10556b9",
      "skos:note": "Determination may come into operation on a later date specified in the determination."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-1-sec-1055b-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1055B(2) Operation of determination of superannuation complaint",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 30,
      "values:originalText": "(2) AFCA may specify in the determination that the determination is\nnot to come into operation until a later date specified in the\n\nExternal dispute resolution  Schedule 1\nAmendments applying from the day after Royal Assent  Part 1\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the\nAustralian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018\nCompilation date: 10/08/2022\nRegistered: 25/08/2022\n\ndetermination and, if a later date is so specified, the determination\ncomes into operation on that date."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1055b-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1055b-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1055b-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1055B(3) Operation of determination of superannuation complaint",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-1-sec-1055b-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2022c00235.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2022c00235.pdf, p.30",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If, under subsection 1055(4) or (5), the determination varies a\ndecision of another person, or substitutes a decision for a decision\nof another person, that decision as varied or substituted:\n\n(a) is, for all purposes (other than the making of a complaint\nabout the decision) taken to be a decision of the other person;\nand\n\n(b) on the coming into operation of the determination by AFCA,\nunless AFCA otherwise orders, has effect, and is taken to\nhave had effect, on and from the day on which the original\ndecision has or had effect.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If, under subsection 1055(4) or (5), the determination varies a\ndecision of another person, or substitutes a decision for a decision\nof another person, that decision as varied or substituted:\n\n(a) is, for all purposes (other than the making of a complaint\nabout the decision) taken to be a decision of the other person;\nand\n\n(b) on the coming into operation of the determination by AFCA,\nunless AFCA otherwise orders, has effect, and is taken to\nhave had effect, on and from the day on which the original\ndecision has or had effect.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1055b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1055b-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1055b-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1055b-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1055b-ss-3-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1055b-ss-3-logic-deontic-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1055b-ss-3-logic-deontic-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "48cf3e0306e9acc1c7194974e4ef9f85af029e05e8932b4d1f3a3e7c00599cba",
      "skos:note": "Decision of another person is taken to be a decision of the other person for all purposes."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-1-sec-1055b-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1055B(3) Operation of determination of superannuation complaint",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 30,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If, under subsection 1055(4) or (5), the determination varies a\ndecision of another person, or substitutes a decision for a decision\nof another person, that decision as varied or substituted:\n\n(a) is, for all purposes (other than the making of a complaint\nabout the decision) taken to be a decision of the other person;\nand\n\n(b) on the coming into operation of the determination by AFCA,\nunless AFCA otherwise orders, has effect, and is taken to\nhave had effect, on and from the day on which the original\ndecision has or had effect."
    },
    {
