    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1055c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1055C Evidence of determination of superannuation complaint",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-1-sec-1055c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2022c00235.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2022c00235.pdf, p.31",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A document purporting to be a copy of AFCA’s determination of a\nsuperannuation complaint, and purporting to be certified, by an\nAFCA staff member who is authorised to do so, to be a true copy\nof the determination, is, in any proceeding, prima facie evidence of\nthe determination.\n\n(2) This section does not affect any other method available by law for\nthe proof of determinations of AFCA.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A document purporting to be a copy of AFCA’s determination of a\nsuperannuation complaint, and purporting to be certified, by an\nAFCA staff member who is authorised to do so, to be a true copy\nof the determination, is, in any proceeding, prima facie evidence of\nthe determination.\n\n(2) This section does not affect any other method available by law for\nthe proof of determinations of AFCA.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1055c-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1055c-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fc943b0aed493aae98dcd77b8aca08c55b305e5a69d0bac01d8df187ff97afdc"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-1-sec-1055c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1055C Evidence of determination of superannuation complaint",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 31,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A document purporting to be a copy of AFCA’s determination of a\nsuperannuation complaint, and purporting to be certified, by an\nAFCA staff member who is authorised to do so, to be a true copy\nof the determination, is, in any proceeding, prima facie evidence of\nthe determination.\n\n(2) This section does not affect any other method available by law for\nthe proof of determinations of AFCA."
    },
