    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1057a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1057A(4) Operation and implementation of determination that is",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-1-sec-1057a-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2022c00235.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2022c00235.pdf, p.34",
      "values:originalText": "(4) An order in force under subsection (2) (including an order that has\npreviously been varied on one or more occasions under\nsubsection (3)):\n\n(a) is subject to such conditions as are specified in the order; and\n\n(b) has effect until:\n\n(i) if a period for the operation of the order is specified in\nthe order—the end of that period or, if a decision is\ngiven on the appeal before the end of that period, the\ngiving of the decision; or\n\n(ii) if no period is so specified—the giving of a decision on\nthe appeal.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) An order in force under subsection (2) (including an order that has\npreviously been varied on one or more occasions under\nsubsection (3)):\n\n(a) is subject to such conditions as are specified in the order; and\n\n(b) has effect until:\n\n(i) if a period for the operation of the order is specified in\nthe order—the end of that period or, if a decision is\ngiven on the appeal before the end of that period, the\ngiving of the decision; or\n\n(ii) if no period is so specified—the giving of a decision on\nthe appeal.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1057a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1057a-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1057a-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "97989a68a877b2783738c0f6864aece6e44e26b598eddd558f6ddb332234d1c9",
      "skos:note": "Order subject to conditions and has effect until decision on appeal."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-1-sec-1057a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1057A(4) Operation and implementation of determination that is",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 34,
      "values:originalText": "(4) An order in force under subsection (2) (including an order that has\npreviously been varied on one or more occasions under\nsubsection (3)):\n\n(a) is subject to such conditions as are specified in the order; and\n\n(b) has effect until:\n\n(i) if a period for the operation of the order is specified in\nthe order—the end of that period or, if a decision is\ngiven on the appeal before the end of that period, the\ngiving of the decision; or\n\n(ii) if no period is so specified—the giving of a decision on\nthe appeal."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-1057a-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
