      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nSubsection 1052B(3)\n100 penalty units for each day, or part of a\nday, in respect of which the offence is\ncommitted.\n311A\nSubsection 1052BA(4)\n100 penalty units for each day, or part of a\nday, in respect of which the offence is\ncommitted.\nSubsection 1052C(6)\n100 penalty units for each day, or part of a\nday, in respect of which the offence is\ncommitted.\nRetirement Savings Accounts Act 1997",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\nSubsection 1052B(3)\n100 penalty units for each day, or part of a\nday, in respect of which the offence is\ncommitted.\n311A\nSubsection 1052BA(4)\n100 penalty units for each day, or part of a\nday, in respect of which the offence is\ncommitted.\nSubsection 1052C(6)\n100 penalty units for each day, or part of a\nday, in respect of which the offence is\ncommitted.\nRetirement Savings Accounts Act 1997",
