      "cof:title": "5 At the end of section 7A",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 37,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(4) The Tribunal Chairperson may, by writing, delegate any or all of\nhis or her functions or powers to any Tribunal member.\n\nSchedule 1  External dispute resolution"
