      "dc:source": "c2022c00235.pdf, p.38",
      "values:originalText": "Omit “subsection 62(2)” (wherever occurring), substitute “section 62”.\n\nExternal dispute resolution  Schedule 1\nAmendments applying once the first authorisation of an external dispute resolution\nscheme comes into force  Part 2\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the\nAustralian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018\nCompilation date: 10/08/2022\nRegistered: 25/08/2022",
      "skos:definition": "Omit “subsection 62(2)” (wherever occurring), substitute “section 62”.\n\nExternal dispute resolution  Schedule 1\nAmendments applying once the first authorisation of an external dispute resolution\nscheme comes into force  Part 2\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the\nAustralian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018\nCompilation date: 10/08/2022\nRegistered: 25/08/2022",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-10-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5ec0cac2c25a726e63a1942e2585aa3763067623af9b029c8913e2a54319ca1b",
      "skos:note": "Replace 'subsection 62(2)' with 'section 62'"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-1-sec-10",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 Section 63",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 38,
      "values:originalText": "Omit “subsection 62(2)” (wherever occurring), substitute “section 62”.\n\nExternal dispute resolution  Schedule 1\nAmendments applying once the first authorisation of an external dispute resolution\nscheme comes into force  Part 2\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the\nAustralian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018\nCompilation date: 10/08/2022\nRegistered: 25/08/2022"
    },
