      "dc:source": "c2022c00235.pdf, p.39",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(hba) decisions making, or forming part of the process of making,\nor leading up to the making of, determinations under the\nAFCA scheme (within the meaning of Chapter 7 of the\nCorporations Act 2001);\nAustralian Defence Force Cover Act 2015",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(hba) decisions making, or forming part of the process of making,\nor leading up to the making of, determinations under the\nAFCA scheme (within the meaning of Chapter 7 of the\nCorporations Act 2001);\nAustralian Defence Force Cover Act 2015",
