      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(a) must be a member of the AFCA scheme (within the meaning\nof Chapter 7 of the Corporations Act 2001); and\nNote:\nThis paragraph is inserted in subsection 47(1) of the Retirement Savings Accounts Act\n1997 as enacted by item 7 of Schedule 2 to this Act.\nSuperannuation Industry (Supervision) Act 1993",
