      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\nExternal dispute resolution  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to requiring membership of the AFCA scheme  Part 3\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the\nAustralian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018\nCompilation date: 10/08/2022\nRegistered: 25/08/2022\n\n(a) must be a member of the AFCA scheme; and\nNote:\nThis paragraph is inserted in subsection 101(1) of the Superannuation Industry\n(Supervision) Act 1993 as enacted by item 9 of Schedule 2 to this Act.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\nExternal dispute resolution  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to requiring membership of the AFCA scheme  Part 3\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the\nAustralian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018\nCompilation date: 10/08/2022\nRegistered: 25/08/2022\n\n(a) must be a member of the AFCA scheme; and\nNote:\nThis paragraph is inserted in subsection 101(1) of the Superannuation Industry\n(Supervision) Act 1993 as enacted by item 9 of Schedule 2 to this Act.",
      "cml:asserts": [
