      "dc:source": "c2022c00235.pdf, p.50",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the note, substitute:\nNote:\nIf an individual is dissatisfied with a statement given to the\nCommissioner by a superannuation provider under section 390-5 in\nthis Schedule, the individual may make a complaint under the AFCA\nscheme (within the meaning of Chapter 7 of the Corporations Act\n2001).",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the note, substitute:\nNote:\nIf an individual is dissatisfied with a statement given to the\nCommissioner by a superannuation provider under section 390-5 in\nthis Schedule, the individual may make a complaint under the AFCA\nscheme (within the meaning of Chapter 7 of the Corporations Act\n2001).",
      "cml:asserts": [
