    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-58",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58 Application of amendments",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-1-sec-58"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2022c00235.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2022c00235.pdf, p.50",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Part apply on and after the day that is:\n\n(a) the day specified under subitem (2); or\n\n(b) if no such day is specified—the day that is 12 months after\nthe day (the Part 3 application day) on and after which the\namendments made by Part 3 apply.\nNote:\nFor the application of the amendments made by Part 3: see item 44.\n\nExternal dispute resolution  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to closing off existing external dispute resolution schemes  Part 4\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the\nAustralian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018\nCompilation date: 10/08/2022\nRegistered: 25/08/2022\n\n(2)\nThe Minister may, by notifiable instrument, specify a day for the\npurposes of paragraph (1)(a). The day must not be:\n\n(a) earlier than the Part 3 application day; or\n\n(b) later than 12 months after the Part 3 application day.\n(3)\nIf the day specified under subitem (2) is the Part 3 application day, the\namendments made by this Part apply on and from the time immediately\nafter the start of the Part 3 application day.\n\nSchedule 1  External dispute resolution",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Part apply on and after the day that is:\n\n(a) the day specified under subitem (2); or\n\n(b) if no such day is specified—the day that is 12 months after\nthe day (the Part 3 application day) on and after which the\namendments made by Part 3 apply.\nNote:\nFor the application of the amendments made by Part 3: see item 44.\n\nExternal dispute resolution  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to closing off existing external dispute resolution schemes  Part 4\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the\nAustralian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018\nCompilation date: 10/08/2022\nRegistered: 25/08/2022\n\n(2)\nThe Minister may, by notifiable instrument, specify a day for the\npurposes of paragraph (1)(a). The day must not be:\n\n(a) earlier than the Part 3 application day; or\n\n(b) later than 12 months after the Part 3 application day.\n(3)\nIf the day specified under subitem (2) is the Part 3 application day, the\namendments made by this Part apply on and from the time immediately\nafter the start of the Part 3 application day.\n\nSchedule 1  External dispute resolution",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-58-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-58-logic-alleninterval-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "000c9abe0188f81c07447ed0bd62672423c8e3f25ac80c6a07fe1eb1c1ba147a",
      "skos:note": "Specifies the day on which amendments apply"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-1-sec-58",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58 Application of amendments",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 50,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Part apply on and after the day that is:\n\n(a) the day specified under subitem (2); or\n\n(b) if no such day is specified—the day that is 12 months after\nthe day (the Part 3 application day) on and after which the\namendments made by Part 3 apply.\nNote:\nFor the application of the amendments made by Part 3: see item 44.\n\nExternal dispute resolution  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to closing off existing external dispute resolution schemes  Part 4\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the\nAustralian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018\nCompilation date: 10/08/2022\nRegistered: 25/08/2022\n\n(2)\nThe Minister may, by notifiable instrument, specify a day for the\npurposes of paragraph (1)(a). The day must not be:\n\n(a) earlier than the Part 3 application day; or\n\n(b) later than 12 months after the Part 3 application day.\n(3)\nIf the day specified under subitem (2) is the Part 3 application day, the\namendments made by this Part apply on and from the time immediately\nafter the start of the Part 3 application day.\n\nSchedule 1  External dispute resolution"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-58-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-58"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-58-logic-alleninterval-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "<=",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Defines the start of the amendment application period",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3)",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the day that is 12 months after the Part 3 application day"
    },
    {
