      "dc:source": "c2022c00235.pdf, p.52",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the heading, substitute:\n\nExternal dispute resolution  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to no longer requiring membership of existing external dispute\nresolution schemes  Part 5\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the\nAustralian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018\nCompilation date: 10/08/2022\nRegistered: 25/08/2022",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the heading, substitute:\n\nExternal dispute resolution  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to no longer requiring membership of existing external dispute\nresolution schemes  Part 5\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the\nAustralian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018\nCompilation date: 10/08/2022\nRegistered: 25/08/2022",
      "cml:asserts": [
