    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-72",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "72 Application of amendments",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-1-sec-72"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2022c00235.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2022c00235.pdf, p.53",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Part apply on and after the day that is:\n\n(a) the day specified under subitem (2); or\n\n(b) if no such day is specified—the day that is 12 months after\nthe day (the Part 4 application day) on and after which the\namendments made by Part 4 apply.\nNote:\nFor the application of the amendments made by Part 4: see item 58.\n(2)\nThe Minister may, by notifiable instrument, specify a day for the\npurposes of paragraph (1)(a). The day must not be:\n\n(a) earlier than the Part 4 application day; or\n\n(b) later than 12 months after the Part 4 application day.\n\nSchedule 1  External dispute resolution",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Part apply on and after the day that is:\n\n(a) the day specified under subitem (2); or\n\n(b) if no such day is specified—the day that is 12 months after\nthe day (the Part 4 application day) on and after which the\namendments made by Part 4 apply.\nNote:\nFor the application of the amendments made by Part 4: see item 58.\n(2)\nThe Minister may, by notifiable instrument, specify a day for the\npurposes of paragraph (1)(a). The day must not be:\n\n(a) earlier than the Part 4 application day; or\n\n(b) later than 12 months after the Part 4 application day.\n\nSchedule 1  External dispute resolution",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-1-sec-72-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "423707c96b3a2be94825d60f86a33be0a227c7fd1041ae625de9eca5519117c2",
      "skos:note": "Conditional commencement of amendments"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-1-sec-72",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "72 Application of amendments",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 53,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Part apply on and after the day that is:\n\n(a) the day specified under subitem (2); or\n\n(b) if no such day is specified—the day that is 12 months after\nthe day (the Part 4 application day) on and after which the\namendments made by Part 4 apply.\nNote:\nFor the application of the amendments made by Part 4: see item 58.\n(2)\nThe Minister may, by notifiable instrument, specify a day for the\npurposes of paragraph (1)(a). The day must not be:\n\n(a) earlier than the Part 4 application day; or\n\n(b) later than 12 months after the Part 4 application day.\n\nSchedule 1  External dispute resolution"
    },
    {
