    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-2-sec-243c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "243C ASIC may publish internal dispute resolution data",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-2-sec-243c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2022c00235.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2022c00235.pdf, p.55",
      "values:originalText": "(1) ASIC may publish information relating to internal dispute\nresolution that is:\n\n(a) information given to ASIC under any of the following:\n\n(i) subparagraph 912A(1)(g)(ii) or paragraph 1017G(1)(d)\nof the Corporations Act 2001;\n\n(ii) paragraph 47(1)(ha) of the National Consumer Credit\nProtection Act 2009;\n\n(iii) paragraph 47(1)(c) of the Retirement Savings Accounts\nAct 1997;\n\n(iv) paragraph 101(1)(c) of the Superannuation Industry\n(Supervision) Act 1993; or\n\n(b) information derived from information of a kind referred to in\nparagraph (a).\n\n(2) Information published under this section may relate to a particular\nentity, or may be information from which a particular entity may\nbe identified, but must not be personal information within the\nmeaning of the Privacy Act 1988.\nCorporations Act 2001",
      "skos:definition": "(1) ASIC may publish information relating to internal dispute\nresolution that is:\n\n(a) information given to ASIC under any of the following:\n\n(i) subparagraph 912A(1)(g)(ii) or paragraph 1017G(1)(d)\nof the Corporations Act 2001;\n\n(ii) paragraph 47(1)(ha) of the National Consumer Credit\nProtection Act 2009;\n\n(iii) paragraph 47(1)(c) of the Retirement Savings Accounts\nAct 1997;\n\n(iv) paragraph 101(1)(c) of the Superannuation Industry\n(Supervision) Act 1993; or\n\n(b) information derived from information of a kind referred to in\nparagraph (a).\n\n(2) Information published under this section may relate to a particular\nentity, or may be information from which a particular entity may\nbe identified, but must not be personal information within the\nmeaning of the Privacy Act 1988.\nCorporations Act 2001",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-2-sec-243c-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-2-sec-243c-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "94f3fe13521c1ea518ef2cbc69a27c688533c5c048b920d5f710f6921d0c9c63"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-2-sec-243c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "243C ASIC may publish internal dispute resolution data",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 55,
      "values:originalText": "(1) ASIC may publish information relating to internal dispute\nresolution that is:\n\n(a) information given to ASIC under any of the following:\n\n(i) subparagraph 912A(1)(g)(ii) or paragraph 1017G(1)(d)\nof the Corporations Act 2001;\n\n(ii) paragraph 47(1)(ha) of the National Consumer Credit\nProtection Act 2009;\n\n(iii) paragraph 47(1)(c) of the Retirement Savings Accounts\nAct 1997;\n\n(iv) paragraph 101(1)(c) of the Superannuation Industry\n(Supervision) Act 1993; or\n\n(b) information derived from information of a kind referred to in\nparagraph (a).\n\n(2) Information published under this section may relate to a particular\nentity, or may be information from which a particular entity may\nbe identified, but must not be personal information within the\nmeaning of the Privacy Act 1988.\nCorporations Act 2001"
    },
    {
