    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-2-sec-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2 Paragraph 912A(1)(g)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-2-sec-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2022c00235.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2022c00235.pdf, p.55",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(g) if those financial services are provided to persons as retail\nclients:\n\n(i) have a dispute resolution system complying with\nsubsection (2); and\n\nSchedule 2  Internal dispute resolution\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the\nAustralian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018\n\nCompilation date: 10/08/2022\nRegistered: 25/08/2022\n\n(ii) give ASIC the information specified in any instrument\nunder subsection (2A); and",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(g) if those financial services are provided to persons as retail\nclients:\n\n(i) have a dispute resolution system complying with\nsubsection (2); and\n\nSchedule 2  Internal dispute resolution\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the\nAustralian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018\n\nCompilation date: 10/08/2022\nRegistered: 25/08/2022\n\n(ii) give ASIC the information specified in any instrument\nunder subsection (2A); and",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-2-sec-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-2-sec-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "878779ee1db0080e842eb7e552ec6bf88da8a6d7182996b683709e7149d97eb5",
      "skos:note": "Provide a dispute resolution system complying with subsection (2) and give ASIC the information specified in any instrument under subsection (2A)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-2-sec-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2 Paragraph 912A(1)(g)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 55,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(g) if those financial services are provided to persons as retail\nclients:\n\n(i) have a dispute resolution system complying with\nsubsection (2); and\n\nSchedule 2  Internal dispute resolution\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the\nAustralian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018\n\nCompilation date: 10/08/2022\nRegistered: 25/08/2022\n\n(ii) give ASIC the information specified in any instrument\nunder subsection (2A); and"
    },
