      "skos:definition": "fund)\nRepeal the definition, substitute:\nregulated superannuation fund includes a scheme covered by\nparagraph (c) of the definition of regulated superannuation fund\nin section 761A of the Corporations Act 2001.\n\nSchedule 3  Repeal of the Superannuation (Resolution of Complaints) Act 1993",
