      "values:originalText": "Repeal the item, substitute:\nthe operator of the AFCA\nscheme (within the meaning of\nChapter 7 of the Corporations\n(a) is of information that was obtained\nunder or in relation to the\nSuperannuation (Unclaimed Money\n\nRepeal of the Superannuation (Resolution of Complaints) Act 1993  Schedule 3\nConsequential amendments  Part 2\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the\nAustralian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018\nCompilation date: 10/08/2022\nRegistered: 25/08/2022\n\nAct 2001)\nand Lost Members) Act 1999; and\n(b) is for the purpose of the operator\nperforming any of its functions or\nexercising any of its powers.\n\nSchedule 3  Repeal of the Superannuation (Resolution of Complaints) Act 1993",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the item, substitute:\nthe operator of the AFCA\nscheme (within the meaning of\nChapter 7 of the Corporations\n(a) is of information that was obtained\nunder or in relation to the\nSuperannuation (Unclaimed Money\n\nRepeal of the Superannuation (Resolution of Complaints) Act 1993  Schedule 3\nConsequential amendments  Part 2\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the\nAustralian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018\nCompilation date: 10/08/2022\nRegistered: 25/08/2022\n\nAct 2001)\nand Lost Members) Act 1999; and\n(b) is for the purpose of the operator\nperforming any of its functions or\nexercising any of its powers.\n\nSchedule 3  Repeal of the Superannuation (Resolution of Complaints) Act 1993",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-3-sec-31-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-3-sec-31-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e076273c18fb8c6158088236641123772195f41eac5bdf093f5cd6edebb70c5f",
      "skos:note": "Operator of AFCA scheme must provide information for performing functions or exercising powers."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-3-sec-31",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "31 Subsection 355-65(3) in Schedule 1 (table item 3)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 64,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the item, substitute:\nthe operator of the AFCA\nscheme (within the meaning of\nChapter 7 of the Corporations\n(a) is of information that was obtained\nunder or in relation to the\nSuperannuation (Unclaimed Money\n\nRepeal of the Superannuation (Resolution of Complaints) Act 1993  Schedule 3\nConsequential amendments  Part 2\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Putting Consumers First—Establishment of the\nAustralian Financial Complaints Authority) Act 2018\nCompilation date: 10/08/2022\nRegistered: 25/08/2022\n\nAct 2001)\nand Lost Members) Act 1999; and\n(b) is for the purpose of the operator\nperforming any of its functions or\nexercising any of its powers.\n\nSchedule 3  Repeal of the Superannuation (Resolution of Complaints) Act 1993"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-3-sec-31-norm",
