    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-3-sec-32",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "32 Existing determinations unaffected",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-3-sec-32"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2022c00235.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2022c00235.pdf, p.66",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe repeal of the Superannuation (Resolution of Complaints) Act 1993\nby Part 1 of this Schedule, does not affect a determination made under\nthat Act before the commencement of that Part.\n(2)\nThe amendments of Acts made by Part 2 of this Schedule do not apply\nin relation to such a determination, and those Acts continue to apply\nafter the commencement of that Part in relation to such a determination\nas if those amendments had not been made.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe repeal of the Superannuation (Resolution of Complaints) Act 1993\nby Part 1 of this Schedule, does not affect a determination made under\nthat Act before the commencement of that Part.\n(2)\nThe amendments of Acts made by Part 2 of this Schedule do not apply\nin relation to such a determination, and those Acts continue to apply\nafter the commencement of that Part in relation to such a determination\nas if those amendments had not been made.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-3-sec-32-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-3-sec-32-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3e818dc758f71a979e24c6fda7489f89f581b18f0d48c616c0a60f1cdb975842",
      "skos:note": "Existing determinations unaffected by repeal or amendments"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022c00235#sch-3-sec-32",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32 Existing determinations unaffected",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 66,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe repeal of the Superannuation (Resolution of Complaints) Act 1993\nby Part 1 of this Schedule, does not affect a determination made under\nthat Act before the commencement of that Part.\n(2)\nThe amendments of Acts made by Part 2 of this Schedule do not apply\nin relation to such a determination, and those Acts continue to apply\nafter the commencement of that Part in relation to such a determination\nas if those amendments had not been made."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022c00235-sch-3-sec-32-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
